{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50905","headline":"白鹿洞二首 二 · 王贞白","name":"白鹿洞二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一上西园避暑亭，芰荷香细午风轻。\n眼前物物皆佳兴，并作吟窝一味清。\n（此二首从清余姚邵启贤辑、武昌陶氏刊本《王贞白诗》中补得。\n邵氏序谓此二首系据家刻本续补，《全唐诗》所未收者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}